 ## Install
 
-The `event` extra is pinned to the exact Runfold Event source revision used by
-this integration:
+The `event` extra requires `runfold-event==0.1.0`. After that distribution is
+published, install the Nexent extra normally:
 
 ```bash
 uv pip install './sdk[event]'
 ```
 
-The current pin is `runfold-event` 0.1.0 from Runfold runtime data commit
-`cb5916e`. Production deployments may install
-the wheel built from that revision instead, as long as they keep the same
-package version and Event v0 format.
+Before registry publication, build and install the matching Runfold wheel
+locally, then install the Nexent extra; the already installed exact version
+satisfies the dependency:
+
+```bash
+python -m pip wheel --no-deps --wheel-dir /tmp/runfold-dist \
+  /absolute/path/to/runfold/packages/event/python
+uv pip install /tmp/runfold-dist/runfold_event-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl
+uv pip install -e './sdk[event]'
+```
+
+This integration was validated against `runfold-event` 0.1.0 from Runfold
+commit `cb5916e`. Keep the same package version and Event v0 format.
 
